 "homepage": "https://www.projectoberon.net/",
 "influenced_by": ["modula-2", "pascal"],
 "related": [{"id": "modula-2", "relation": "successor-of"}],
 "level_notes": {"1": "Each dialect is defined by a short report by its designers: Oberon (1988 SP&E paper; revised report on Wirth's ETH pages), Oberon-2 (Mössenböck/Wirth, 1991), Oberon-07 (revised 2016). There is no ISO standard.", "0": "Project Oberon (2013 edition) publishes the complete system, including Wirth's Oberon-07 compiler for his RISC processor, as plain-text sources on Wirth's ETH pages. Independent compilers include OBNC (Oberon-07 to C) and Vishap Oberon (Oberon-2)."},
